{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a mysterious post-apocalyptic wasteland inspired by the worlds of Fallout and Dune, you have been left to die. Facing brutal mutant enemies, impossible terrain, and dwindling supplies, your only hope is to put your trust in a wandering service-bot called ALAN. Together you will explore, fight and survive, in your bid to escape The Wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571610/extras/5c3e212a3f9c46f6fc1386d567ebce95.avif?t=1770988597\" width=1000 height=257 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571610/extras/6c859bcd36ba4641f214b5fb61699d22.webp?t=1770988597\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571610/extras/6c859bcd36ba4641f214b5fb61699d22.poster.avif?t=1770988597\" class=\"bb_img\" width=333 height=70 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ALAN is an eccentric and optimistic robot who loves a good sunset. But behind his buoyant personality is a mechanical marvel, capable of unnatural agility and strength. Use ALAN to move heavy boulders, hoist you up to high places, and battle mutant monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571610/extras/150c2c85242894e7fb1098b8f782aad2.webp?t=1770988597\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571610/extras/150c2c85242894e7fb1098b8f782aad2.poster.avif?t=1770988597\" class=\"bb_img\" width=380 height=64 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration is key to escaping The Wasteland. Find quirky and dangerous characters, scavenge for water and supplies, and uncover the ancient lore of the nuclear apocalypse. Rolling sand dunes, creepy caves, radiation lakes and towering cliffs are just some of the environments you'll find on your travels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571610/extras/201ed497d5dba2b32a8ce1d3e090b9d8.avif?t=1770988597\" width=388 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In true Metroidvania style, new areas are ability locked. But not by your abilities - by ALAN's. Upgrade ALAN with scraps you find on your journey to give him powerful and exciting abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571610/extras/a6dd294890304a3d7092233458d7c7a6.poster.avif?t=1770988597\" width=500 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571610/extras/a6dd294890304a3d7092233458d7c7a6.webm?t=1770988597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571610/extras/a6dd294890304a3d7092233458d7c7a6.mp4?t=1770988597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Giant worms roam the radioactive wasteland. They are terrifying, deadly, and <i>glorious (</i>as the resident cultists would say)<i>.</i> Where they came from, why they're here and how they got so big is largely unknown. Can <strong>you</strong> unearth their secrets?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2571610?t=1770988597","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571610/a63b630ff97ef9b2803700ae648dcf0d082c808a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770988597","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571610/4dea266bda096822c76c4ce624937719f91a3e4e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770988597","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571610/4dea266bda096822c76c4ce624937719f91a3e4e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770988597","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4186550,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a mysterious post-apocalyptic wasteland inspired by the worlds of Fallout and Dune, you have been left to die. Facing brutal mutant enemies, impossible terrain, and dwindling supplies, your only hope is to put your trust in a wandering service-bot called ALAN. Together you will explore, fight and survive, in your bid to escape The Wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571610/extras/5c3e212a3f9c46f6fc1386d567ebce95.avif?t=1770988597\" width=1000 height=257 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571610/extras/6c859bcd36ba4641f214b5fb61699d22.webp?t=1770988597\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571610/extras/6c859bcd36ba4641f214b5fb61699d22.poster.avif?t=1770988597\" class=\"bb_img\" width=333 height=70 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ALAN is an eccentric and optimistic robot who loves a good sunset. But behind his buoyant personality is a mechanical marvel, capable of unnatural agility and strength. Use ALAN to move heavy boulders, hoist you up to high places, and battle mutant monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571610/extras/150c2c85242894e7fb1098b8f782aad2.webp?t=1770988597\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571610/extras/150c2c85242894e7fb1098b8f782aad2.poster.avif?t=1770988597\" class=\"bb_img\" width=380 height=64 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration is key to escaping The Wasteland. Find quirky and dangerous characters, scavenge for water and supplies, and uncover the ancient lore of the nuclear apocalypse. Rolling sand dunes, creepy caves, radiation lakes and towering cliffs are just some of the environments you'll find on your travels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571610/extras/201ed497d5dba2b32a8ce1d3e090b9d8.avif?t=1770988597\" width=388 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In true Metroidvania style, new areas are ability locked. But not by your abilities - by ALAN's. Upgrade ALAN with scraps you find on your journey to give him powerful and exciting abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571610/extras/a6dd294890304a3d7092233458d7c7a6.poster.avif?t=1770988597\" width=500 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571610/extras/a6dd294890304a3d7092233458d7c7a6.webm?t=1770988597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571610/extras/a6dd294890304a3d7092233458d7c7a6.mp4?t=1770988597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Giant worms roam the radioactive wasteland. They are terrifying, deadly, and <i>glorious (</i>as the resident cultists would say)<i>.</i> Where they came from, why they're here and how they got so big is largely unknown. Can <strong>you</strong> unearth their secrets?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Burning Fort Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2571610/d487cbc0bf7e53e9ceeba9306655a35c0d3e3d95/header.jpg?t=1770988597","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Full Steam Deck support</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Sonoma<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon or Intel Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2571610/1252006194/f1f54866db5f25b71feeb207d67499b4bb6d39c2/1769798217/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769798674","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2571610/1252006194/f1f54866db5f25b71feeb207d67499b4bb6d39c2/1769798217/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769798674","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2571610/1252006194/f1f54866db5f25b71feeb207d67499b4bb6d39c2/1769798217/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1769798674","id":257227971,"name":"Vitrified Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257227971/cc34419028c3f1161a8dbd2f0a9012b9c51cb3d3/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1769798674"}],"name":"Vitrified","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3<br></li>